---
title: Suspicious NPM/PyPI Package Install During Interview or Take-Home Test Context
id: 4f6a7b8c-9d1e-4f3a-b2c3-5d6e7f8a9b01
status: experimental
description: Detects package manager installs from a developer directory named in a way consistent with a coding-challenge or interview repository, matching Lazarus's Contagious Interview delivery vector for BeaverTail/InvisibleFerret.
author: Dalton Hunter
date: 2026/08/23
references:
    - https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0032/
tags:
    - attack.initial_access
    - attack.t1195.002
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_pm:
        Image|endswith:
            - '\npm.cmd'
            - '\npm.exe'
            - '\yarn.cmd'
            - '\pip.exe'
    selection_context:
        CurrentDirectory|contains:
            - 'interview'
            - 'coding-test'
            - 'take-home'
            - 'skill-test'
            - 'assessment'
    condition: selection_pm and selection_context
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate internal hiring-assessment tooling built and vetted in-house
level: medium

